  year\, need-based\, by invitation or application (nominations accepted).\
 n\nOrganisation: Craigardan\nLocation: Elizabethtown\, New York\, USA (Adi
 rondack Park). In person\; rural\, car recommended.\nAward: USD 4\,600 fel
 lowship toward a minimum two-week residency (covers the residency fee)\, p
 lus a USD 500 honorarium. Travel\, materials and personal expenses are not
  covered. USD 25 application fee (waivers available on request).\nDuration
 : Minimum two weeks\, during the summer season (May to October 2027)\n\nMo
 re: https://craigardan.org/fellowships?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantde
 sk&utm_medium=referral
