 FA x ISCP): funded three-month Brooklyn studio residency (USD 9\,000 stipe
 nd)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 08 Dec 2026 at 17:00 EST.\n\nNYFA\, sculptor George Petr
 ides and the International Studio & Curatorial Program (ISCP) offer one Gr
 eek artist a fully funded three-month studio residency in Brooklyn. WHO: a
 rtists who have lived full time in Greece for at least two years\, hold a 
 valid Greek passport and are at least 30\; artist duos may apply. ISCP gen
 erally requires strong English and does not host people enrolled in school
